{
  "category": "Hypnosis Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it is very hungry, it puts humans it meets to sleep, then it feasts on their dreams.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always holding a pendulum that it rocks at a steady rhythm, it causes drowsiness in anyone nearby.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "The longer it swings its pendulum, the longer the effects of its hypnosis last.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "HYPNO holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this POKéMON searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "HYPNO holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this POKéMON searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum in a HYPNO’s hand lull the foe into deep hypnosis. While searching for prey, it polishes the pendulum.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It carries a pendulum-like device. There once was an incident in which it took away a child it hypnotized.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.",
