    {
      "text": "Hypno holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this Pokémon searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hypno holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this Pokémon searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "While it is an extremely dangerous Pokémon, people who are in need of a good, sound sleep call it their savior.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "As a matter of course, it makes anyone it meets fall asleep and has a taste of their dreams. Anyone having a good dream, it carries off.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Alola, Komala is Hypno’s main target. It rarely harms people.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "There are some Hypno that assist doctors with patients who can’t sleep at night in hospitals.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum.",
